{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/702d2acb1743b524f094111a6d406052.poster.avif?t=1765503253\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/702d2acb1743b524f094111a6d406052.webm?t=1765503253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON ITSELF</strong> is a short, fast-paced roguelike boss rush game with action-packed combat. The game mixes the power-up system from <i>Hades</i> and the fast, intense combat of <i>ULTRAKILL</i> into one action-packed experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a superhuman who is sent into hell to defy death itself, in order to complete humanity longetivity experiment purpose. Along the way, you\u2019ll face powerful bosses, collect crazy upgrades, and try to survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you finish the mission and beat death? Or will you be lost forever in the depths of hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/783513892a21294036ecd0595c3ada6f.poster.avif?t=1765503253\" width=1000 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/783513892a21294036ecd0595c3ada6f.webm?t=1765503253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/783513892a21294036ecd0595c3ada6f.mp4?t=1765503253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>5 weapons</strong>, each with unique power-ups like bleed, attack speed, curse, healing and more. Switch between them to create deadly combos. Some lower defense, some dash, some act as ultimates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/eb8588b032da8e289cfb5c9c8e39f3d2.poster.avif?t=1765503253\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/eb8588b032da8e289cfb5c9c8e39f3d2.webm?t=1765503253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/extras/eb8588b032da8e289cfb5c9c8e39f3d2.mp4?t=1765503253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>8 waves</strong> of deadly bosses. Use weapon combos, dodge, parry, and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007610?t=1765503253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007610?t=1765503253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/7976a7fbe581dcfd0d5beff28a9e8a121e26c8f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765503253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007610/7976a7fbe581dcfd0d5beff28a9e8a121e26c8f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765503253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shar